<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>AI 晚报</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="static/favicon.svg?v=20260428-icon1" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="static/favicon-32x32.png?v=20260428-icon1" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="static/favicon-16x16.png?v=20260428-icon1" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="static/apple-touch-icon.png?v=20260428-icon1" />
    <link rel="preload" href="static/GoogleSans-Variable.ttf" as="font" type="font/ttf" crossorigin />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="static/styles.css?v=20260428-daily-v6" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="page">
      <header class="topbar">
        <div class="topbar-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Daily AI Briefing</p>
          <h1>AI 晚报</h1>
          <p class="hero-copy">每天一页。先给判断，再给链接，再把完整正文留给还想继续往下读的人。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="topbar-side">
          <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="site sections">
            <a class="site-nav-link" href="/">首页</a>
            <a class="site-nav-link is-active" href="/daily/">AI 晚报</a>
            <a class="site-nav-link" href="/paper/">Paper Hub</a>
          </nav>
          <div class="header-meta" aria-label="Daily report stats">
            <div class="stat stat-update">
              <small>latest report</small>
              <span id="last-updated">—</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat" aria-label="报告数量">
              <small>reports</small>
              <span id="report-count">0</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>
      <section>
        <div id="report-list" class="report-list"></div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <script src="static/app.js?v=20260428-daily-v6"></script>
  </body>
</html>
